  "summary": "Sky Sports reports that Everton striker Thierno Barry has worked on his finishing and confidence after a difficult first season in England. His individual coach, Scott Chickelday, says extra training has helped him recover from setbacks and focus on the next chance. Barry scored against Crystal Palace, hit a cup hat-trick at Preston and supplied the winning goal against Ipswich. The next challenge is to produce those performances more consistently, with Everton facing Hull on Sunday.",
